s\", \"B. have\", \"C. had\", \"D. having\"],\n      \"answer\": \"B\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"question_number\": 8,\n      \"question\": \"He **loves** his cat.\",\\n\\n**Choose the correct verb form:**\",\n      \"options\": [\"A. loved\", \"B. love\", \"C. is loving\", \"D. loves\"],\n      \"answer\": \"D\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"question_number\": 9,\n      \"question\": \"I **buy** milk every morning.\",\\n\\n**Choose the correct verb form:**\",\n      \"options\": [\"A. bought\", \"B. buying\", \"C. is buying\", \"D. buy\"],\n      \"answer\": \"D\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"question_number\": 10,\n      \"question\": \"She **works** at a school.\",\\n\\n**Choose the correct verb form:**\",\n      \"options\": [\"A. worked\", \"B. is working\", \"C. work\", \"D. works\"],\n      \"answer\": \"D\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
